WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:17.320
"Attention, students and teachers.

2
00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:21.091
Because of heavy snow, we will close the school at two o'clock today,"

3
00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:24.841
Ms. Folani's voice announced over the loudspeaker.

4
00:00:24.842 --> 00:00:28.144
"We want everyone to get home safely."

5
00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:33.926
In her second-grade room, Nina wondered, "Will we have Kids Central today?"

6
00:00:33.927 --> 00:00:38.620
In his third-grade room, Jason wondered the same thing.

7
00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:42.473
Just then Miss Shelly stuck her head in the door.

8
00:00:42.474 --> 00:00:45.543
"We'll start Kids Central at two today.

9
00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:50.071
You'll stay until your parents arrive to pick you up, okay?" she said.

10
00:00:50.072 --> 00:00:54.994
Jason nodded. Bobby gave her a thumbs-up sign.

11
00:00:54.995 --> 00:00:58.594
"Nina, Izzie, and Bobby, your moms just called.

12
00:00:58.595 --> 00:01:02.652
They will be here at four o'clock," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:01:02.653 --> 00:01:05.987
"That gives us just enough time for our activity.

14
00:01:05.988 --> 00:01:08.583
Did you all bring your aprons?"

15
00:01:08.584 --> 00:01:11.971
"What about my dad?" Jason asked.

16
00:01:11.972 --> 00:01:14.424
"When is he coming?"

17
00:01:14.425 --> 00:01:18.180
Jason's dad always picked him up on Wednesdays.

18
00:01:18.181 --> 00:01:22.937
And they always went out for pizza afterward.

19
00:01:22.938 --> 00:01:25.917
"I haven't gotten a call from your dad yet.

20
00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:31.833
But don't worry, I'm sure he'll come at five o'clock as usual," Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:37.413
"Today we'll bake snow brownies," said Miss Shelly.

22
00:01:37.414 --> 00:01:45.105
"Yay! Brownies," Izzie said. "But what's a snow brownie?"

23
00:01:45.106 --> 00:01:48.021
Jason didn't hear Miss Shelly's answer.

24
00:01:48.022 --> 00:01:51.110
He was still thinking about his dad.

25
00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:53.606
Why hadn't he called?

26
00:01:53.607 --> 00:02:01.018
"Step 1: Preheat the oven to 175 degrees Celsius.

27
00:02:01.019 --> 00:02:04.642
Jason, would you do that?" Miss Shelly asked.

28
00:02:04.643 --> 00:02:11.451
"What? Oh, okay." Jason set the temperature on the oven.

29
00:02:11.452 --> 00:02:15.729
"Step 2: Grease a baking pan.

30
00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.895
Miss Shelly, can I grease the pan this time?" Nina asked.

31
00:02:20.896 --> 00:02:32.057
"Of course. Here is some oil and a paper towel," the teacher said.

32
00:02:32.058 --> 00:02:35.002
"Who will read step 3?"

33
00:02:35.003 --> 00:02:41.315
"Me! Step 3: Beat the melted butter and sugar. Sugar, please."

34
00:02:41.316 --> 00:02:48.995
Izzie held out her hand for the sugar.

35
00:02:48.996 --> 00:03:00.398
"Step 4," Bobby read. "Beat in eggs and vanilla."

36
00:03:00.399 --> 00:03:08.351
"Step 5: Stir in cocoa powder and flour.

37
00:03:08.352 --> 00:03:14.413
Hellooo, Jason! Can you pour the flour?" Nina asked.

38
00:03:14.414 --> 00:03:18.921
"Step 6: Stir in salt and baking powder."

39
00:03:18.922 --> 00:03:25.685
Izzie added the salt and baking powder.

40
00:03:25.686 --> 00:03:27.780
"We're ready to bake!"

41
00:03:27.781 --> 00:03:32.885
Miss Shelly lifted the pan into the oven.

42
00:03:32.886 --> 00:03:36.256
"These should be done in about 27 minutes."

43
00:03:36.257 --> 00:03:41.464
While the brownies baked, the kids measured the snow that had collected on the windows.

44
00:03:41.465 --> 00:03:48.558
"12 centimeters here!" Izzie cried.

45
00:03:48.559 --> 00:03:53.234
"Time to turn these into snow brownies," Miss Shelly called.

46
00:03:53.235 --> 00:03:57.088
Each kid placed a paper snowflake over the baking pan.

47
00:03:57.089 --> 00:04:00.783
Miss Shelly shook powdered sugar on top.

48
00:04:00.784 --> 00:04:06.276
When the kids lifted the paper snowflakes, there was a pretty snow pattern.

49
00:04:06.277 --> 00:04:08.784
Five o'clock came and went.

50
00:04:08.785 --> 00:04:15.090
After everyone left, Miss Shelly and Jason cleaned the tables and washed the dishes.

51
00:04:15.091 --> 00:04:17.602
Then they read a book together.

52
00:04:17.603 --> 00:04:23.315
Finally, at six o'clock, the gym door opened.

53
00:04:23.316 --> 00:04:27.822
"What is that delicious smell?" a man asked.

54
00:04:27.823 --> 00:04:32.645
"Dad!" Jason jumped up and ran to his father.

55
00:04:32.646 --> 00:04:34.614
"Sorry I'm late.

56
00:04:34.615 --> 00:04:39.499
I was in a meeting and couldn't use my phone," his dad said.

57
00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.262
"Ready to go home?

58
00:04:41.263 --> 00:04:44.415
I'm afraid it's too snowy for pizza."

59
00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:54.661
"That's okay. We can have brownies for dinner!" Jason said.
